// Title: Most recently written keys in this hive
// Why: Keys written shortly before acquisition - persistence, configuration changes and tool artefacts tend to be among them.
// FalsePositives: Windows updates, AV and software constantly touch some keys (e.g. under Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer).
{Hive}
| where Type == "Key" and isnotnull(LastWriteTime)
| summarize LastWriteTime = max(LastWriteTime) by Key = strcat(Key, @"\", Name)
| top 200 by LastWriteTime desc
